<title>JAPAN: Oriental Land shares first trade at 8,850 yen.</title>
<headline>Oriental Land shares first trade at 8,850 yen.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in newly listed Oriental Land Co Ltd were first traded at 8,850 yen on Wednesday on the Tokyo Stock Exchange.  </p>
<p>Oriental Land, which operates the Tokyo Disneyland theme park, was listed on the TSE on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The share price had jumped to 9,030 yen as of 0058 GMT, after it had been bid-only for about 30 minutes after the opening.</p>
